      "findings": "Reddit Iusedtobealawyer, 2025-01-17, m7jkz2b: first-hand Wave is less sticky than SS; continues SS because they think it has more glycerin. Direct comparative texture, no direct SS hydration or purchase/repurchase assertion. SKU/version unknown. Score 6, material_positive=false, observation time and independence unavailable; shares the Regimen Lab thread with A17/A18. Parent's Level Serum purchase/intended repurchase belongs to another actor and product."
    },
    {
      "key": "A04",
      "findings": "Junip customer 202931541, 2025-03-22, review 7540631: SS is lightweight, refreshing, fast-drying, very hydrating, non-clogging-feeling and useful before makeup. Ordered SS after sister's introduction; bought Buffer Jelly seeking greater nighttime hydration/repair, then face wash and mesh moisturizer. Reports overnight glow with Buffer Jelly and makeup removal, hydration and no more breakouts with cleanser; these are separate-product outcomes. Refill target metadata is not an explicit repurchase narrative; formula unknown. Credited origin; 0 up/0 down observed 2025-03-23."
    },
    {
      "key": "A07",
      "findings": "Junip customer 122992865, 2025-01-17, review 6884815: body is only 'undefined...', so hydration, texture and behavior evidence are unavailable. Context identifies SS, First Time target, combo skin and verified-buyer metadata; none supplies missing testimony or narrated acquisition. Formula unknown. Credited identity; 0 up/0 down observed 2025-01-17. Excluded from all diagnostic counts."
    },
    {
      "key": "A08",
      "findings": "Junip customer 152576810, 2024-02-02, review 4653282: age 51 with challenging skin, reports SS leaves skin hydrated when paired with tretinoin and other actives. Direct hydration under that routine, without isolating SS's contribution; no texture or explicit buying consequence. Context resolves SS First Time target and combo/acne-prone skin; version unknown. Credited origin; 0 up/0 down observed 2024-02-02."
    },
    {
      "key": "A09",
      "findings": "Junip customer 55537943, 2022-12-09, review 1866323: Avant Guard mask locks in hydration from SS; joint mask-serum retention cannot be allocated separately. Deducted one star for poor fit on a very small head, especially around nose. Context identifies Avant Guard Small Head and dry/acne-prone skin. No direct SS texture or purchase/remedy action; versions unknown. Credited origin; 0 up/0 down observed 2022-12-09."
    },
    {
      "key": "A10",
      "findings": "Junip customer 97396127, 2023-07-21, review 3515905: Buffer Jelly, resolved by context, retains unspecified hydrating products as a final nighttime step; little needed and wakes with glowing skin. No SS identification, so neither direct nor SS-specific joint hydration corroboration. No explicit acquisition/repurchase consequence; formula unknown. Credited origin; 0 up/0 down observed 2023-07-21."
    },
    {
      "key": "A13",
      "findings": "Junip customer 231128721, 2024-12-06, review 6685187: SS retention/plump hydration through a 12-hour shift; reports less sensitivity/irritation, no forehead congestion, nourished dry cheeks and reduced natural oil with oily T zone, dry sensitive cheeks and mild rosacea. Sticky, shiny, slick texture; sometimes goes out wearing a pump, suggests small amounts or nighttime use, and advises sticky-averse readers to avoid. These suggestions do not establish actual abandonment or population behavior. Direct hydration and texture; duration/secondary benefits are single-source details. Formula unknown, verified_buyer=false; credited origin; 0 up/0 down observed 2024-12-06."
    },
    {
      "key": "A14",
      "findings": "Junip customer 344086099, 2025-08-05, review 8950945: explicitly gifted Buffer Jelly, used twice; jelly becomes fluid oil with silky slip. With a drop in nighttime moisturizer, reports soft skin without redness, irritation or clogged pores despite rosacea. Dermaplaning suitability and long bottle life are predictions; initial small-bottle surprise and reduced-packaging explanation are the reviewer's perceptions. Declares brand conversion, not paid acquisition. Not SS evidence; formula unknown. Credited origin; 0 up/0 down observed 2025-08-20. Free receipt remains disclosed despite rewarded=false metadata."
    },
    {
      "key": "A15",
      "findings": "Junip customer 210150638, 2024-11-04, review 6567933: Plasma Wash has beautiful silky texture but poor cleansing across wet/dry skin, different quantities and lathering methods; little/no foam, severe eye burning, less clean/moisturized feeling than favored glycerin cleanser and greater dryness after two washes. Considered return, not completed return; uncertain about defect or technique, citing others' positive social-media accounts without independent testimony. Counters A04's cleanser experience, not SS hydration. Formula unknown. Credited origin; 0 up/0 down observed 2024-11-04."
    },
    {
      "key": "A17",
      "findings": "Reddit Live_Rhubarb_7560, 2025-01-17, m7kd5t6: has never tried Experiment because it does not ship there; speculates Wave is thinner than SS from stated 10% versus 30% glycerin. Likes Wave/hydrating serums, but supplies no SS hydration or first-hand texture. First-hand other-product details include Zerafite being more emollient/less pilling-prone than C.R.E.A.M, easier C.R.E.A.M use mixed with Wave, and sometimes wanting an oily extra layer; formulation explanation is their attribution. Score 7, material_positive=false; observation time/independence unavailable. Same thread as A03/A18; contextual A18 repeat is not a new origin."
    },
    {
      "key": "A18",
      "findings": "Reddit orchidmommy, 2025-01-16, m7j3q3q: Wave is the most hydrating product they have used; C.R.E.A.M left skin drier overnight than another moisturizer and pilled under daytime sunscreen, so was not for them. No SS testimony or completed switching/return narrative. Score 10, material_positive=false; observation time/independence unavailable. Context_f05862db0ee1dcb8c8c6 is this same account and statement, not added corroboration. Product versions unknown."
    }
  ],
